abstract: >-
  R package implementing VITROB, a result-level, algorithm-based risk-of-bias
  tool for in vitro experiments modelled on RoB 2 and ROBINS-I V2. It proposes
  domain and overall judgments, checks assessments for entry errors, draws
  traffic-light, summary, answer and reporting-gap plots, and includes a
  point-and-click app.
